# Every checkout uses LF, Windows included (25 Oct 2026). Expo's fingerprint hashes file
# contents, so a build made from a Windows checkout with CRLF endings got a different runtime
# version (e5567ad…) from the one GitHub's Release workflow computes on Linux (b28b8de9…), and
# no update published by CI reached it. Prettier also expects LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
